OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry day with plenty of sunny
OL,6,Fspells and some patchy cloud. Windy
OL,7,Finitially but winds gradually easing
OL,8,Fthrough the afternoon. Feeling
OL,9,Fpleasant in the sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry with mostly clear skies,
OL,12,Fleading to a chilly night. Cloud
OL,13,Flikely to build from the west towards
OL,14,Fdawn. Winds light.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FA bright start, but soon
OL,17,Fbecoming cloudy with outbreaks of
OL,18,Frain. Rain becoming mainly confined to
OL,19,Fthe Pennines during the afternoon,
OL,20,Fwith brighter spells developing in the
OL,21,Feast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
