OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fbut mostly dry Tuesday. Outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain likely Wednesday, likely heavy at
OL,8,Ftimes. Fine and sunny Thursday. Warm
OL,9,Fby day, but chilly Wednesday and
OL,10,FThursday nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
